{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年42歲的前TVB小生蔡淇俊，自2014年離巢後北上發展創業，先後開設過米線店、火鍋店，可惜最終相繼結業，更一度蝕近幾百萬，被網民封為「執笠界KOL」。</p><p>但蔡淇俊屢敗屢戰，轉戰直播帶貨並成立新公司，至今已成立6年，早前更帶多位員工一齊團建。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:24:02.306917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:01:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:20.915274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:20.915274+00:00","content_hash":"297a66fffea5beb0e997a53f7fa8078d4ec253543c001db05f8241397b1f6e89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}